Google and its affiliates engage the third-party entities in the table below to perform limited activities in connection with Stitch. The table shows what activity each entity performs.

### Third-Party Subprocessors

| Entity Name | Activity | Country where processing is performed | Website |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Composio, Inc.** | Third-party tool and API integrations on the user’s behalf | *United States of America* | [composio.dev](https://composio.dev) |`),le=goog.getMsg(`*Last modified: September 9, 2026*

Google and its affiliates engage the third-party entities in the table below to perform limited activities in connection with Stitch. The table shows what activity each entity performs.

### Third-Party Subprocessors

| Entity Name | Activity | Country where processing is performed | Website |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Sampark Inc, (dba Composio)** | Third-party tool and API integrations on the user’s behalf | *United States of America* | [composio.dev](https://composio.dev) |`),ue=goog.getMsg(`Subprocessors`),de=goog.getMsg(`Additional Terms of Service for {$stitchProductName}`,{stitchProductName:W}),fe=goog.getMsg(`**You’re the Driver.** Stitch outputs are not always guaranteed to be accurate. You can use Stitch workspaces, projects and canvases to collaborate with other users on your team and are responsible for ensuring your team’s use of Stitch aligns with your organization’s internal policies and legal obligations.

* **Review your work:** You are responsible for supervising Stitch. You must independently verify all AI-generated suggestions—including code commits and repository changes—before taking action.
* **Autonomous Actions:** If you authorize the product to act autonomously, you assume all responsibility for the impact on your project or production systems.
* **Notice:** You agree to notify all team members whose data may be processed by Stitch about these Terms and the [Privacy Notice](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/terms/privacy).

**Connected Third Party Services.** Stitch may connect to your external development environments or tools (like GitHub) at your direction. By connecting an external service, you authorize Google to access and share data with that service on your behalf to perform tasks like suggested bug fixes. You confirm that you have the authority to connect these services and that your use complies with those third-party terms.`),pe=goog.getMsg(`Terms of Service`),me=goog.getMsg(`By continuing, you (1) acknowledge the [Stitch Privacy Notice](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/terms/privacy) and the [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy), and (2) agree to the [Stitch Additional Terms of Service](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/terms) and the [Google Terms of Service](https://policies.google.com/terms).`),he=goog.getMsg(`Failed to accept Terms of Service. Please try again.`),ge=goog.getMsg(`Continue`),_e=goog.getMsg(`Continuing...`),ve=goog.getMsg(`Go Back`),ye=goog.getMsg(`Privacy for {$stitchProductName}`,{stitchProductName:W}),be=goog.getMsg(`**Last updated: October 23, 2026**

This notice and the [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy) describe how Stitch handles your data.

### Your Control Over AI Training

You are in control of whether your data is used to train Google’s generative AI models:

* **Your Data is Protected:** Google does not train our generative AI models on your full connected codebase or other 3P integrations or the full data within your connected development environments (like GitHub or Render).
If you opt in to training, we only learn from the specific interactions you have with Stitch or feedback you submit.
* **Training & Opt In:** By default, we will not train on any of your data.
If you opt in to training, we may train our generative AI models on activity traces within Stitch and feedback provided. Activity traces may include your interactions with Stitch, including context fragments (such as relevant code or data), your specific prompts, Stitch’s suggestions and outputs, and how you interact with those suggestions.

### How we use your data

When you use Stitch, we process your data in line with our [Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy) and this Privacy Notice to provide, improve, and develop Google products and services. For example:

* **Product Improvement:** We may use this data to improve Stitch generally. In line with our commitment above, we won’t train our generative AI models on your data unless you’ve opted in to training.
* **Quality Review:** A sample of your data may also be reviewed by trained human reviewers to ensure quality.
* **Feedback:** When you share thumbs up or thumbs down feedback, we’ll also collect the associated content – like your prompts, conversations, uploads, and the outputs received (e.g., chats, generated designs, etc.) – so we can understand the issue. This data is handled in line with our [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy) and is used to help us improve the product for everyone.

When you collaborate in Stitch, anything you share or upload in a project or workspace may also be accessed by other members of that project or workspace.`),xe=goog.getMsg(`Website URL`),Se=goog.getMsg(`Connectors`),Ce=goog.getMsg(`Google Workspace`),we=goog.getMsg(`Stitch Loop`),Te=goog.getMsg(`Couldn't update connector permission. Try again.`),Ee=goog.getMsg(`{$figmaProductName} selection link`,{figmaProductName:K}),De=goog.getMsg(`Import from Photos`),Oe=goog.getMsg(`Failed to connect to {$figmaProductName}. Please try again.`,{figmaProductName:K}),ke=goog.getMsg(`Failed to open Google Drive. Please try again.`),Ae=goog.getMsg(`Failed to open Google Photos. Please try again.`),je=goog.getMsg(`Paste {$figmaProductName} selection link...`,{figmaProductName:K}),Me=goog.getMsg(`Explore creative directions with {$nanoBananaProductName} image model.`,{nanoBananaProductName:q}),Ne=goog.getMsg(`Explore creative directions with our most advanced image model.`),Pe=goog.getMsg(`Design fast with {$geminiModel}. Export designs to code or {$figmaProductName}.`,{geminiModel:`${G} Flash`,figmaProductName:K}),Fe=goog.getMsg(`High-quality designs in HTML with {$geminiModel}. Export to coding agents.`,{geminiModel:`${G} 3 Flash`}),Ie=goog.getMsg(`Uses {$geminiModel}. Prioritizes maximum quality and reasoning over speed.`,{geminiModel:`${G} 3.1 Pro`}),Le=goog.getMsg(`Redesign existing apps or sites with {$nanoBananaProProductName}. Attach a screenshot.`,{nanoBananaProProductName:`${q} Pro`}),Re=goog.getMsg(`Bring a problem to solve and see solutions.`),ze=goog.getMsg(`{$geminiModel} for rapid collaboration, still good quality.`,{geminiModel:`${G} 3.5 Flash-Lite`}),Be=goog.getMsg(`{$geminiModel} for a balance between speed and high quality.`,{geminiModel:`${G} 3.8 Flash`}),Ve=goog.getMsg(`Speed`),He=goog.getMsg(`Balanced`),Ue=goog.getMsg(`{$stitchName} Agent`,{stitchName:W}),We=goog.getMsg(`Our new agentic design partner.`),Ge=goog.getMsg(`Meet our new design agent. Think of it as yo